### Agregar punto a una ejecución con referencia existente por locationId — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1,
  "radius": 100,
  "minTime": 10,
  "maxTime": 30,
  "minHour": "2026-08-21T08:00:00",
  "maxHour": "2026-08-21T17:00:00"
}

### Agregar punto con referencia existente por privateCode — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-EXISTENTE",
  "comments": "Entrega en bodega",
  "minTime": 15,
  "maxTime": 45
}

### Agregar punto creando la referencia (privateCode nuevo + nombre + coordenadas + cliente) — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "privateCode": "REF-NUEVA-ADD-001",
  "locationName": "Referencia nueva addLocation",
  "locationAddress": "4a avenida 15-45 zona 10, Guatemala",
  "latitude": 14.6349,
  "longitude": -90.5069,
  "radius": 100,
  "customerPrivateCode": "CLI-001"
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1,
  "locationId": 1
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "locationId": 1,
  "minTime": 10
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/addLocation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999,
  "locationId": 1
}
